"Stardate 06.15.**** 04:17\n\nGah! What wasss in nasssty food? Feel ssso ssstrange... weak... Floran fear nassssty mussshrooms... What hasss mussshroom done to Floran? Can feel... thingsss... growing in Floran... Ssssss...Hoooom... [unintelligible]",

